      "id": "claim_39e3db6fde81481fa7e2cd99a2b6b35c",
      "statement": "Two independent permission gates apply: scopes (ops:execute, resources:read, resources:write) defaulting to ops:execute when the column is NULL for legacy keys, and allowed_projects where NULL means all projects — enforced via require_scope for manage tools and check_token/check_project for project-scoped tools.",
