      "id": "claim_7e052ce7a9594b23b2e0d92d84193b0b",
      "statement": "Manage write tools use a two-phase confirm_token: the first call returns a change preview and a one-time 32-hex token with a 5-minute TTL bound to the action string, the second call with the token persists the change; tokens live in process memory and are invalidated by restart.",
